blender-mcp (shared dependency) pinned revision
================================================
repo : https://github.com/ahujasid/blender-mcp
commit: 3ab8925
title: fix: remove per-call polyhaven probe and serialize socket access to prevent MCP timeouts (#279)

This repo is a nested vendor dependency with its own origin. We do NOT copy it
into each test project. Instead we record this pinned revision so every agent
can reproduce the identical blender-mcp server behavior.

Reason it must be pinned:
  - BlenderMCP addon v1.2 hard-refuses `--background` mode (addon.py lines 112-116);
    server command execution depends on the GUI main-thread timer loop.
  - All three agents talk to the SAME Blender instance (localhost:9876).
  - Both Claude and Codex MCP client configs point at this package:
      Claude: <proj>/.venv/bin/blender-mcp        (stdio)
      Codex : uvx --python 3.11 blender-mcp       (stdio)
